  "what_this_is": "The Workshop rows for tools/book-time: the times a person can be booked (their weekly windows minus what is already booked and what their calendar shows busy), booking one of those times as a record in their own records with a lifecycle, and putting, moving and cancelling the event on the person's own Google calendar with their own account, or making the invitation file for any mail client.",
